<%- include('../partials/top') %>
<%- include('../partials/crumbs') %>
<section class="wrap section-tight">
  <div class="prose glass-panel pad">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p>This policy explains how <%= s.site_name %> handles personal information submitted through this website.</p>
    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <p>When you send an inquiry we collect the details you enter (name, email, company, country, phone, quantity and message), the page you sent it from, campaign parameters in the URL, your IP address and browser type. If analytics is enabled we use Google Analytics to measure site usage.</p>
    <h2>How we use it</h2>
    <p>We use your information only to reply to your inquiry, prepare quotations and manage orders. We may share product requirements (not your contact details) with factories to obtain quotations. We do not sell personal data.</p>
    <h2>Retention</h2>
    <p>Inquiry records are kept for as long as needed for business correspondence and legal obligations, and deleted on request.</p>
    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p>You can ask us to access, correct or delete your data by emailing <a href="mailto:<%= s.contact_email %>"><%= s.contact_email %></a>.</p>
    <h2>Cookies</h2>
    <p>The public website does not set cookies of its own. Analytics cookies are set only if Google Analytics is enabled.</p>
  </div>
</section>
<%- include('../partials/bottom') %>
